# Codebase Index

Full map: `docs/CODEBASE_INDEX.md` · Agent cold-start: `AGENT_INDEX.md`

## Active code (edit here)

| Layer | Path |
|-------|------|
| CLI | `awos.py` |
| Kernel loop | `scaffold/agent/orchestrator.py` |
| Planner / Worker / Verifier | `planner.py`, `worker.py`, `react_worker.py`, `verifier.py` |
| Reward + routing | `reward_store.py`, `ml_router.py`, `escalation_engine.py` |
| Self-learning | `prompt_evolver.py`, `live_tool_synth.py`, `scaffold_evolver.py` |
| Sessions | `runtime_session.py`, `virtual_execution_runtime.py`, `worktree.py` |
| Tests | `tests/test_*.py` |
| Demos | `scripts/demo_*.sh` |

## Not active kernel

- `src/` — legacy TypeScript fork (indexing excluded)
- `.awos/worktrees/` — session copies (blocked from index)
- `compute/` — Stage 2 placeholder only

## Common entry points

- New CLI command → `awos.py` `build_parser()` + `cmd_*`
- Orchestrator change → read `orchestrator.py` + `runtime_session.py`
- Live proof → `scripts/demo_<f>.sh` + `docs/<f>_proof.md` (mandatory for kernel features)
